# Everything that is NOT part of the shipped Nextcloud app.
# This file is the single source of truth for the app's content: the Dockerfile copies the
# whole context minus these patterns, and `make build` feeds the same file to rsync
# (--exclude-from) so the release tarball and the image carry identical files.
# (scripts/ is excluded by the Makefile only — the Dockerfile needs it for the entrypoint.)
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
Jenkinsfile
Makefile
composer.json
composer.lock
phpunit.xml
phpunit.integration.xml
*.cache
tests/
vendor/
dist/
node_modules/
STORE.md
